{"id":"n64559-1-12","stage":1,"title":"내려오다 · 下来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64559-1-12-1","ko":"승규야, 너 나무 위에 그렇게 높이 올라가다가 다치면 어떻게 해? 어서 내려와.","zh":"承奎，你爬得那么高在树上，要是受伤了怎么办？快下来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규야,","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"승규야","audio":"/audio/7df699add291e5b9b746.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나무","meaning":"树，树木","explanation":"나무：树，树木","readings":[{"term":"나무","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32750","senseId":"1","lemma":"나무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"1","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"높이","meaning":"高高地","explanation":"높이：高高地","readings":[{"term":"높이","audio":"/audio/c2c8f0007728427c3e8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48746","senseId":"1","lemma":"높이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라가다가","meaning":"上，登上，爬上","explanation":"올라가다：上，登上，爬上；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"올라가다","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89867","senseId":"15","lemma":"올라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다치면","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어서","meaning":"快","explanation":"어서：快","readings":[{"term":"어서","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67026","senseId":"1","lemma":"어서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려와.","meaning":"下来","explanation":"내려오다：下来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"1","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b294b251f77dfbc5","term":"나무","zh":"树，树木","audio":"/audio/b294b251f77dfbc5ede4.mp3","entryId":"32750","definition":"拥有坚硬的茎杆，上面长有枝叶的多年生植物。","pronunciation":["나무"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"比某基准更高的一方；或指比中间更高的一方。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"c2c8f0007728427c","term":"높이","zh":"高高地","audio":"/audio/c2c8f0007728427c3e8a.mp3","entryId":"48746","definition":"从下而上高地。","pronunciation":["노피"]},{"id":"bfc58fbbb2f76325","term":"올라가다","zh":"上，登上，爬上","audio":"/audio/bfc58fbbb2f7632503c1.mp3","entryId":"89867","definition":"走向高处。","pronunciation":["올라가다"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"596b9885add9128d","term":"어서","zh":"快","audio":"/audio/596b9885add9128d0c53.mp3","entryId":"67026","definition":"用于催促做事或行动。","pronunciation":["어서"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"下来","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3","entryId":"64559","definition":"从高处来到低处或从上面来到下面。","pronunciation":["내려오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/89a7245e50c17d1b2ee8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64559-1-12-2","ko":"네, 곧 내려갈게요.","zh":"好的，我马上下来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려갈게요.","meaning":"下，下去","explanation":"내려가다：下，下去；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"9","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"马上，就","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"不拖延，紧接着。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下，下去","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"从某个高处移动到低处。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2d8cfef91b368be1cc8a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.82,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64559","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我马上下来。","妈妈，您长了好多白头发。","承奎，你爬得那么高在树上，要是受伤了怎么办？快下来吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好的，我马上下来。","承奎，你爬得那么高在树上，要是受伤了怎么办？快下来吧。","妈妈，您长了好多白头发。"],"answer":0}]}
